<h1 align="center">📄 Simple CV Website – Mohamed Kamel</h1>

<p align="center">
  A clean and responsive personal CV website built using pure HTML, CSS, and Font Awesome.  
  The design focuses on simplicity, readability, and modern layout structure.
</p>

<hr/>

<h2>📌 Project Overview</h2>
<p>
  This project is a simple and elegant <strong>CV (Resume) website</strong> created to showcase personal information, skills, education, and experience.  
  The layout is crafted using modern CSS techniques with a responsive design that adapts to different screen sizes.
</p>

<h2>✨ Features</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Fully responsive layout</li>
  <li>Clean and modern minimalist design</li>
  <li>Profile section with personal information</li>
  <li>Skills & language progress bars</li>
  <li>Education and professional experience sections</li>
  <li>Custom background shapes using CSS clip-path</li>
  <li>Google Fonts integration</li>
  <li>Font Awesome icons for contact info</li>
</ul>

<h2>🛠️ Technologies Used</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>HTML5</strong></li>
  <li><strong>CSS3</strong> (Flexbox, clip-path, responsive design)</li>
  <li><strong>Font Awesome</strong> (icons)</li>
  <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong></li>
</ul>

<h2>📂 Project Structure</h2>

<pre>
project/
│── index.html
│
├── CSS/
│   └── style.css
│
└── Images/
    ├── icon-cv.png
    └── my-img.jpg
</pre>

<h2>🚀 How to Use</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Download or clone the repository:</li>
  <pre>git clone &lt;repository-link&gt;</pre>

  <li>Navigate to the project:</li>
  <pre>cd project</pre>

  <li>Open <code>index.html</code> in your browser.</li>
</ol>

